# Input

```json
{
  "single": { "a": 1 },
  "multiple": { "a": 1, "b": 2 },
  "empty": {},
  "expandedSingle": {
    "a": 1
  },
  "nested": { "a": { "b": 1, "c": 2 } },
  "singleArray": [1],
  "multipleArray": [1, 2, 3],
  "emptyArray": [],
  "expandedSingleArray": [
    1
  ],
  "nestedArray": [[1, 2], { "a": 1, "b": 2 }],
  "singleNestedArray": [{ "a": 1 }],
  "longSingle": { "value": "a value that is long enough to make this single-property object exceed the configured line width" }
}

```


# Options

```json
{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../packages/@biomejs/biome/configuration_schema.json",
  "json": {
    "formatter": {
      "expand": "whenMultiple"
    }
  }
}
```

